{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/Plot_ENG.jpg?t=1753511946\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive at an old, abandoned mansion to begin repairs and restore power. At first glance \u2014 just another job: crumbling walls, faulty wiring, time etched into every corner. But the house breathes. It watches. It\u2019s been waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/eadeb18304ea484a0a87e105c490381c.poster.avif?t=1753511946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/eadeb18304ea484a0a87e105c490381c.webm?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/eadeb18304ea484a0a87e105c490381c.mp4?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each step through the dusty halls uncovers fragments of a forgotten past: lost toys, faded photographs, unsettling notes... and a presence \u2014 faint, but undeniable. Something is here. It doesn\u2019t want you to stay. Or maybe\u2026 it needs you to stay forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/e40d61dd7e88d32d9e0822466dc4e62f.poster.avif?t=1753511946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/e40d61dd7e88d32d9e0822466dc4e62f.webm?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/e40d61dd7e88d32d9e0822466dc4e62f.mp4?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the eerie atmosphere of a decaying estate, where every lamp you fix reveals more than just darkness \u2014 it exposes a story that may have been better left untold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the job. Make your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The house has already named its price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/15364307ec0814e257f8471161bac8ee.poster.avif?t=1753511946\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/15364307ec0814e257f8471161bac8ee.webm?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/15364307ec0814e257f8471161bac8ee.mp4?t=1753511946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/Gameplay_ENG.jpg?t=1753511946\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for items that help you progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple yet engaging puzzles that draw you deeper into the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jumpscares that will make your heart skip a beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constant psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features autosave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outstanding sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playtime: 60 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/Attention_ENG.jpg?t=1753511946\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features puzzles, jumpscares, and stories related to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles may be quite challenging for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're not a fan of this genre, we do not recommend playing this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note! The game features machine translation into the following languages:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- German</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spanish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Portuguese (Brazilian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chinese (Simplified)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Korean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Polish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Japanese</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815050?t=1753511946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/8f7b56d6c7db6d36f06580c35d241c68baa330ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753511946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/4e943c9bf07a8318ff48096b4a275ca7505b8994/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753511946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/4e943c9bf07a8318ff48096b4a275ca7505b8994/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753511946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815050/extras/Plot_ENG.jpg?t=1753511946\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive at an old, abandoned mansion to begin repairs and restore power. At first glance \u2014 just another job: crumbling walls, faulty wiring, time etched into every corner. But the house breathes. It w